<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">通知接收渠道</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">预警总提醒</text>
      <switch color="#4f9e6f" checked="{{prefs.warning_reminder}}" bindchange="onSwitch" data-key="warning_reminder" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">微信推送</text>
      <switch color="#4f9e6f" checked="{{prefs.wechat}}" bindchange="onSwitch" data-key="wechat" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">短信提醒</text>
      <switch color="#4f9e6f" checked="{{prefs.sms}}" bindchange="onSwitch" data-key="sms" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">邮件通知</text>
      <switch color="#4f9e6f" checked="{{prefs.email}}" bindchange="onSwitch" data-key="email" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">夜间免打扰（静默时段）</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">开始时间</text>
      <picker mode="time" value="{{prefs.quiet_start}}" bindchange="onTimeChange" data-key="quiet_start">
        <view class="time-pill">{{prefs.quiet_start}} ▼</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">结束时间</text>
      <picker mode="time" value="{{prefs.quiet_end}}" bindchange="onTimeChange" data-key="quiet_end">
        <view class="time-pill">{{prefs.quiet_end}} ▼</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="hint-text">
      免打扰时段内的短信/微信打扰型通知会自动推迟至时段结束后发送；红色与严重预警将突破静默确保及时触达；站内信随时可查。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card card-tint">
    <view class="card-title">微信订阅消息说明</view>
    <view class="hint-text" style="margin-top:0">
      微信一次性订阅消息每次授权可推送 1 条；站内「消息中心」不受订阅限制，所有预警都会同步入箱。
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="requestSubscribe" wx:if="{{hasTemplate}}">授权微信订阅消息</button>
  </view>

  <button class="btn" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存偏好设置</button>
</view>
